  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making Child Rights a Reality</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will make child rights a reality in Nepal by strengthen the policies and contribute in the formulation of National Plan of Action on children. It will establish and strengthening Child Helplines in all 7 provinces. It will set up the first ever medical programme to focus on the mental health of children and adolescents in cooperation with Kanti Children&#x2019;s Hospital in Kathmandu. Finally it will provide protection and empowerment for girls and vocational training for youth at risk.</narrative>
  </description>
